+    # In the documented rapid independent-phase limit, w has E[w]=1 and
+    # E[w^2]=1+contrast^2/2.  Thus only the quadratic tilt term changes.
+    a2 = a2 * (1.0 + 0.5 * detector_contrast * detector_contrast)
